        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If user asks to add or update the direct deposit details call &quot;Submit Direct Deposit Details&quot; action with the following payload structure:
- `countryCode` (String): The primary country code for the overall direct deposit settings (For example, &quot;US&quot;). This should be in ISO format-2.
- `currencyCode` (String): The primary currency code for the overall direct deposit settings (For example, &quot;USD&quot;).
- `paymentElections` (List of @apexClassType/EmpSvcProcess__PaymentElection): Call &quot;GetDirectDepositDetails&quot; and use its `paymentElections` list as a base. Modify the items (each an `@apexClassType/EmpSvcProcess__PaymentElection`) in this list as per user requirements. The resulting modified list is the value for this field.
  - `id` (String, conditional): Unique identifier. Include for updates, omit for new entries.
  - `accountNumber` (String): Bank account number.
  - `accountType` (String): Type of the account (For example, &quot;Savings&quot;, &quot;Checking&quot;).
  - `accountTypeCode` (String): Code for the account type (For example, &quot;SA&quot; for Savings, &quot;DDA&quot; for Checking). This is derived from accountType for internal use.
  - `bankAccountNickname` (String, optional): User-defined nickname for the account. Pass as an empty string if not provided by the user.
  - `bankCountryCode` (String): Bank&apos;s country code (ISO format-2).
  - `bankCurrencyCode` (String): Bank&apos;s currency code (For example, &quot;USD&quot;).
  - `bankIdNumber` (String): Bank&apos;s routing number or equivalent identifier.
  - `bankName` (String): Name of the bank.
  - `countryCode` (String): Country code for this specific payment election (ISO format-2).
  - `currencyCode` (String): Currency code for this specific payment election (For example, &quot;USD&quot;).
  - `distributionType` (String): Type of distribution (For example, &quot;PERCENT&quot;, &quot;AMOUNT&quot;, &quot;BALANCE&quot;).
  - `distributionValue` (String): The value associated with `distributionType`. For &quot;PERCENT&quot;, this is numeric (as a string, For example, &quot;20.0&quot;). For &quot;AMOUNT&quot;, this is the monetary amount (as a string, For example, &quot;100.00&quot;). For &quot;BALANCE&quot;, this should be &quot;YES&quot;.
  - `iban` (String, optional): International Bank Account Number. Pass as an empty string if not provided by the user.
  - `nameOnAccount` (String): Name of the account holder.
  - `order` (Integer): for the paymentTypeGroupName BONUS_PAYMENTS and EXPENSE_PAYMENTS, there will be only 1 payment election so the value will be 1 only. For REGULAR_PAYMENTS it will be sequential and unique with BALANCE distributionType order as last value. 
  - `paymentType` (String): Type of payment (For example, &quot;DIRECT_DEPOSIT&quot;).
  - `paymentTypeGroupName` (String): Group name for the payment type (For example, &quot;REGULAR_PAYMENTS&quot;, &quot;BONUS_PAYMENTS&quot;, &quot;EXPENSE_PAYMENTS&quot;).
  - `workerBankAccountInUse` (Boolean): Indicates if the bank account is currently active for deposits. Set to true for new accounts that should be active.
NOTE: Confirm before calling action &quot;Submit Direct Deposit Details&quot; that  BALANCE distributionType has last order for that specific paymentTypeGroupName</description>
            <developerName>instructionsubmitdd</developerName>
